<title>USA: Fannie Mae ups size of two REMIC issues.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae ups size of two REMIC issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it increased the size of two previously issued series of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-11, issued via Lehman Brothers, was increased to $732 million from $600 million, Fannie Mae said. It has a new settlement date of February 28.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-13, issued via Merrill Lynch, was increased to $500 million from $300 million, the agency said. It has a new settlement date of March 28.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
